  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Stra 1104.03 Direct Costs. Scholarship awards may only be used to cover direct costs associated with an eligible program. Eligible students shall not receive the cash equivalent of a Governor’s Scholarship.\n\nSource. #12446, INTERIM, eff 1-3-18, EXPIRES: 7-2-18; ss by #12550, eff 6-19-18",
